# Commit Messages

Keep commit messages short and categorized.

## Format

```
[type] short description
```

## Types

- `[cosmetic]` - UI/styling changes, visual tweaks
- `[system]` - Logic, backend, database, infrastructure
- `[fix]` - Bug fixes
- `[docs]` - Documentation only

## Examples

```
[cosmetic] add colors to Shunter of Month card
[system] add email import function
[fix] resolve duplicate entries in rota
[cosmetic] adjust button padding
```

## Rules

- Max 50 characters
- No period at the end
- Lowercase after type tag
- Be specific but brief
